3. Removing the assets
----------------------

The repository does not ship the original installer. If you prefer a build
with no third-party assets at all, delete the four files listed above and
supply your own copies (any 144×81 DIB atlas of the same layout works).
`Tools/tiles_inspect.py` and `Tools/atlas_spec.py` document the exact layout.

